r Path Options Compensation and Classification Recruitment Total Rewards Institutional Equity and Diversity Ethics and Compliance Policies, Forms, Contracts Calendar Schedule Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs) Announcements Human Resources Staff OneHR Customer Service Center Professional and Organizational Development The Learning and Development Team with the Division of Human Resources is committed to providing information, training, facilitation and consultation services to University employees, departments and divisions to ensure excellence in performance and service. This is accomplished by performing assessments, developing and implementing training programs, providing coaching and consultation concerning performance issues, publishing newsletters, coordinating, and delivering professional development opportunities, researching best practices and maintaining a database of employee participation in our programs. See below areas for more information. Employee Orientation Workshops Calendars at a Glance Career Development Supervisor / Managerial Skills Wellness Guide To Community Resources Contact Info Please direct all questions and comments to: training@wpunj.edu M yrna Torres Personnel Aide Phone:  973-720-2887 Fax:  973-720-2090 Torresm7@wpunj.edu Request Info Visit Apply Quick Links Employment Opportunities Campus Map Contact Us Get Connected Event Calendar WP News Give to William Paterson Social Media Directory WP Connect 300 Pompton Road | Wayne, New Jersey 07470 (973) 720-2000 Copyright © 2026 | Privacy Policy"
