reer Ready: Career Resources Career Prep & Resources PowerPaths: Career Experience Program Your Student Success Plan Pioneer to Professional Blog Forage Gain Experience: Jobs & Internships Career Communities Career & Professional Success Badge Career Closet Recruit at WP Faculty & Staff Partners Pesce Family Mentoring Institute Career Events Career Development Center Getting you ready for the workforce From exploring majors to career coaching and internships, the Career Development Center is the first stop on your journey to career success. We offer students and alumni a full suite of services that help you prepare for the next step—and every step beyond. Alumni Careers by the numbers $ 65,049 average starting salary for a WP grad, outpacing national average for public institutions WP alums employed or in graduate school within 6 months of graduation 40,000 Jobs/internships available via the WP Handshake job portal 120,000 Employer partners actively recruiting WP students/alumni Contact Us Career Development Center Student Center 301 300 Pompton Road Wayne, NJ 07470 Phone: 973.720.3291 Fax: 973.720.2074 Our office is open Monday - Friday from 8:30 a.m. - 4:30 p.m. To meet with a member of our staff please schedule an appointment on Navigate , or contact the Main Office at 973.720.3291 or CareerDevelopment@Wpunj.edu We're here to help In addition to a variety of Career Workshops , Employer Information Sessions , Career Fairs , and Career Coaching Sessions each semester, we offer services designed to support individual student and alumni needs. Connect with Us on the WP Handshake Career Portal Explore your Interests, Find your Path with WP Career Communities Build your Skills with the Career and Professional Success Badge Apply for a Career Mentor at the Pesce Family Mentoring Institute Get Hired! Explore Jobs and Internships on Handshake Join Handshake The WP Handshake Career Portal is your one-stop shop for full-time jobs , part-time jobs , internships , events , and signing up for career communities ! Download the mobile app for iPhone and Android to receive customized, real-time listings. Join Handshake Browse Internships Career Events and Fairs Pesce Family Mentoring Institute Join the Pesce Family Mentoring Institute to be individually paired with a mentor in your professional field of interest, who can offer personal career advice and guidance! Learn more » 96% Pesce mentees from Class of 2021 in careers or grad school within 6 months Where WP Works Our alumni are making an impact in careers with local and national businesses like the ones below. * Minority and/or Women Business Enterprise (M/WBE) What Our Graduates Say \"I gained all the building blocks I needed: experience, an internship, and interview skills.\" Heather Cook ’16 Media production and public relations major, landed a full-time job at NBC Universal right out of college. Prior to graduation, she completed a production internship at Discovery Communications. Social @ Career Development Powered by Curator.io Request Info Visit Apply Quick Links Employment Opportunities Campus Map Contact Us Get Connected Event Calendar WP News Give to William Paterson Social Media Directory WP Connect 300 Pompton Road | Wayne, New Jersey 07470 (973) 720-2000 Copyright © 2026 | Privacy Policy"
